OL,3,GNEWSADelays expected as two weekends of
OL,4,AM8 closures begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor bridge works are set to cause
OL,7,Fdisruption on a busy section of
OL,8,FScotland's busiest motorway over the
OL,9,Fnext two weekends.
OL,11,FThe M8 will be closed in both
OL,12,Fdirections in Glasgow between Junction
OL,13,F19 (Anderston) and Junction 24 (Helen
OL,14,FStreet).
OL,16,FThe first closure will run from 18:00
OL,17,Fon Saturday until 13:00 on Sunday,
OL,18,Faffecting the road between Junctions 22
OL,19,Fand 24. Diversions will be in place.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
