OL,3,GNEWSADelays expected as two weekends of
OL,4,AM8 closures begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closures are needed to allow the
OL,7,FKirkwood Street and Cornwall Street
OL,8,Ffootbridges, south-west of the city
OL,9,Fcentre, to be lifted back into place
OL,10,Fafter refurbishment work.
